This ontology is still under development.
It is provided for restricted use and as part of a collaborative framework.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>More about PROMOT initiative at https://www.promotinitiative.com/
</rdfs:seeAlso>
        <owl:versionInfo>2026-03-13</owl:versionInfo>
    </owl:Ontology>
    


