        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000496"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any deviation from the normal motor coordination of the eyes that allows for bilateral fixation on a single object.</obo:IAO_0000115>
