        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Intellectual disability</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Mental deficiency</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Mental retardation</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
