        <obo:IAO_0000115>Failure to thrive (FTT) refers to a child whose physical growth is substantially below the norm.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:PROMOT_1000001>Congenital myopathy HPO KB associations</obo:PROMOT_1000001>
